WEBVTT

00:00:01.661 --> 00:00:04.886
Here is how JobCairn finds and scores jobs.

00:00:05.909 --> 00:00:08.354
Claude searches the job boards in your own

00:00:08.394 --> 00:00:11.357
Chrome, and logs every search with a report.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:13.784
Jobs land in one table.

00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:17.212
Ads that offer sponsorship are pinned to the top.

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:20.404
Each job gets a fit score and a sponsor

00:00:20.444 --> 00:00:22.933
score, so the best bets stand out.

00:00:23.803 --> 00:00:25.649
Open one to read the whole ad.

00:00:25.689 --> 00:00:28.503
The sponsorship line is quoted from it.

00:00:29.298 --> 00:00:31.894
The score checks each must-have against your

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:34.825
history, and the gaps become a study plan.

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:36.872
JobCairn.

00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:39.438
Find the jobs worth your time.

